WEBVTT

00:00:01.844 --> 00:00:04.344
ROKUJOIN ELEMENTARY SCHOOL
Okay, let's begin the morning meeting.

00:00:04.344 --> 00:00:05.184
Okay, let's begin the morning meeting.

00:00:05.184 --> 00:00:06.914
Because of circumstances at home,

00:00:06.914 --> 00:00:09.554
Akashi, Nogami, and Sannomiya
will be absent today.

00:00:09.554 --> 00:00:09.984
Aw, that's lame.

00:00:09.984 --> 00:00:11.854
Okay, attendance time. Asakawa?
Aw, that's lame.

00:00:11.854 --> 00:00:13.584
Okay, attendance time. Asakawa?
I was gonna show off my
new killer move to them.

00:00:13.584 --> 00:00:14.854
Here.
I was gonna show off my
new killer move to them.

00:00:14.854 --> 00:00:16.254
Ikeda?
I was gonna show off my
new killer move to them.

00:00:16.254 --> 00:00:17.394
Here.

00:00:17.394 --> 00:00:18.494
Ueno?

00:00:18.494 --> 00:00:19.724
Here.
I wonder what's keeping them home?

00:00:19.724 --> 00:00:21.164
Enzo?
I wonder what's keeping them home?

00:00:21.164 --> 00:00:21.264
Here.
I wonder what's keeping them home?

00:00:21.264 --> 00:00:21.854
Here.

00:00:22.294 --> 00:00:25.194
It's pretty awesome, invincible power!

00:00:25.604 --> 00:00:28.464
Boy, does it feel great

00:00:28.834 --> 00:00:31.604
Absolutely lovely! So we never lose!

00:00:32.044 --> 00:00:35.204
Come on, let's head for tomorrow!

00:00:37.144 --> 00:00:38.284
Zettai Karen Children

00:00:38.284 --> 00:00:39.444
Zettai Karen Children
Yeah!

00:00:39.444 --> 00:00:40.714
Zettai Karen Children
Absolutely!

00:00:40.714 --> 00:00:42.384
Zettai Karen Children

00:00:42.384 --> 00:00:43.404
Zettai Karen Children
Daring!

00:00:43.584 --> 00:00:46.854
It just takes a touch for me to know

00:00:46.854 --> 00:00:49.324
The limiter on my heart

00:00:50.054 --> 00:00:52.754
Has been released, and then you see

00:00:53.164 --> 00:00:56.354
Yes! Change the world!

00:00:56.594 --> 00:00:59.464
Trying again and again through hot battle!

00:00:59.764 --> 00:01:03.074
Reaching through what's real

00:01:03.074 --> 00:01:06.304
Absolutely lovely! So we never lose!

00:01:06.304 --> 00:01:09.244
The thrills just can't be beat!

00:01:10.374 --> 00:01:16.854
Courage begins to light the
darkness of the world

00:01:16.854 --> 00:01:22.794
It overflows with the miracles you gave

00:01:23.224 --> 00:01:27.624
If you can take pride in a smile

00:01:27.624 --> 00:01:29.624
That suits no one else

00:01:29.834 --> 00:01:34.364
Then let's go beyond the future now

00:01:34.364 --> 00:01:38.464
We can try over the future world!

00:01:38.704 --> 00:01:39.074
Yeah!

00:01:39.804 --> 00:01:40.464
Ultimate!

00:01:42.614 --> 00:01:43.834
Daring!

00:01:53.724 --> 00:01:56.244
7th sense.
"Ordinary! The Children, Restrained"

00:01:58.024 --> 00:02:02.394
2 km to the north-east, moving
south-southwest at 50 kph.

00:02:02.794 --> 00:02:04.594
Okay, we'll start with that one!

00:02:04.594 --> 00:02:06.264
Here we go.

00:02:11.504 --> 00:02:15.444
Here we go! PSYCHIC V-SLASH!

00:02:22.384 --> 00:02:24.014
Kaoru! On your left!

00:02:42.134 --> 00:02:44.944
Whew! Amazing power, as always.

00:02:44.944 --> 00:02:47.344
Stay sharp! There are probably
still enemies in the area.

00:02:47.344 --> 00:02:49.434
We know!

00:02:50.144 --> 00:02:52.084
Found them.

00:02:52.084 --> 00:02:53.514
North-northwest, 1 km.

00:02:53.514 --> 00:02:54.884
Let's take 'em out!

00:02:56.314 --> 00:02:58.184
The Children have moved.

00:02:59.324 --> 00:03:03.484
These small fries are obviously
no match for The Children.

00:03:04.094 --> 00:03:07.164
All right, let's get this started.

00:03:07.164 --> 00:03:09.394
Activating new model ECM!

00:03:16.434 --> 00:03:18.504
The fog's really thick around here.

00:03:18.504 --> 00:03:19.704
Where's the enemy?

00:03:19.704 --> 00:03:21.334
I'm searching for them.

00:03:24.044 --> 00:03:26.014
I can't spot them! I'm being jammed!

00:03:26.014 --> 00:03:26.604
What?!

00:03:32.084 --> 00:03:33.784
Temporary withdrawal!

00:03:33.784 --> 00:03:35.794
Huh? I can't teleport!

00:03:35.794 --> 00:03:36.954
Then I'll take 'em!

00:03:36.954 --> 00:03:38.854
Kaoru, no!

00:03:39.394 --> 00:03:40.294
Oh, no!

00:03:40.294 --> 00:03:44.824
Abort! Abort! Abort test of the ECM!

00:03:45.104 --> 00:03:47.534
PSYCHIC MEGATON PUNCH!

00:03:51.544 --> 00:03:54.274
OW!

00:03:59.914 --> 00:04:01.654
Are you okay, Kaoru?

00:04:01.654 --> 00:04:05.024
She's fine. No broken bones, just a bruise.

00:04:05.024 --> 00:04:05.824
Does it hurt?

00:04:05.824 --> 00:04:06.654
Kaoru...

00:04:06.654 --> 00:04:08.654
It doesn't hurt, not a bit.

00:04:08.654 --> 00:04:09.724
Yes, it does.

00:04:09.724 --> 00:04:12.664
Well, that's why I told you stop.

00:04:12.664 --> 00:04:14.294
It's your fault too, Mr. Minamoto!

00:04:14.294 --> 00:04:17.094
You should have just said we were
doing an ECM test from the start.

00:04:17.094 --> 00:04:19.404
If you knew about the test beforehand,

00:04:19.404 --> 00:04:21.564
we wouldn't get proper results.

00:04:23.134 --> 00:04:24.574
What else are you hiding?

00:04:24.574 --> 00:04:27.174
Nothing! Just the part about the ECM!

00:04:27.174 --> 00:04:28.544
Kaoru, say something, too!

00:04:28.544 --> 00:04:31.014
Um... Well...

00:04:31.014 --> 00:04:32.704
What's ECM?

00:04:36.584 --> 00:04:38.644
That's the ECM.

00:04:41.384 --> 00:04:43.424
ESP Counter Measures.

00:04:43.424 --> 00:04:46.294
In Japanese, chou-nouryoku taikou souchi.

00:04:46.664 --> 00:04:49.154
In short, it's a psychic power jammer.

00:04:51.294 --> 00:04:54.534
I can't believe it could jam a Level 7's powers.

00:04:54.534 --> 00:04:56.334
We heard about it lots of times
in our lectures, right?

00:04:56.334 --> 00:04:58.444
Oh... We have?

00:04:58.444 --> 00:05:01.064
Not a scrap of memory. She must
have slept through it.

00:05:01.574 --> 00:05:06.044
This new ECM generates
a powerful psychic wave,

00:05:06.044 --> 00:05:08.584
and jams out every type of psychic power.

00:05:08.584 --> 00:05:10.814
We had more data for these compared
to the current generation,

00:05:10.814 --> 00:05:12.584
and they're a lot more efficient,

00:05:12.654 --> 00:05:15.354
but their large size remains a drawback.

00:05:16.754 --> 00:05:19.094
Thank heavens you're all right!

00:05:19.094 --> 00:05:21.194
Is your injury okay?

00:05:21.194 --> 00:05:23.664
Is there anything I can do to help?

00:05:23.664 --> 00:05:26.324
Ask me for anything!

00:05:26.934 --> 00:05:28.694
He's the culprit.

00:05:32.444 --> 00:05:33.544
Agh! Chief!

00:05:33.544 --> 00:05:36.774
Boy, that's a relief! I can use my powers!

00:05:36.774 --> 00:05:39.144
Dammit, Kaoru! Stop that!

00:05:39.144 --> 00:05:42.174
No, it's... It's all right, Minamoto.

00:05:42.414 --> 00:05:44.054
Chief!

00:05:44.054 --> 00:05:48.184
I, the chief of BABEL, even
if it was unintentionally,

00:05:48.184 --> 00:05:50.744
caused an esper to be injured!

00:05:51.394 --> 00:05:52.994
This is only fitting.

00:05:52.994 --> 00:05:54.194
But, sir!

00:05:54.194 --> 00:05:55.794
Don't hold back!

00:05:55.794 --> 00:06:00.264
Hit me with the full force of your Level 7 powers!

00:06:00.264 --> 00:06:02.204
Well, if you insist.

00:06:07.574 --> 00:06:11.114
More! More! Hurt me until you feel better!

00:06:11.114 --> 00:06:13.204
Hurt me, please!

00:06:14.044 --> 00:06:16.984
Worst sort of teacher, from the
moment he gets up in the morning...

00:06:19.324 --> 00:06:24.424
But, that ECM's a weapon to be used
to counter espers like us, right?

00:06:24.424 --> 00:06:28.064
Why would BABEL be helping to develop it?

00:06:28.064 --> 00:06:29.794
If those things go on sale,

00:06:29.794 --> 00:06:32.824
we wouldn't be able to use
our powers freely anymore.

00:06:33.064 --> 00:06:37.664
Don't tell me you think it'd be better
if we didn't have our powers.

00:06:37.904 --> 00:06:40.274
N-no, it's not like that!

00:06:40.274 --> 00:06:42.034
You're worried the limiters aren't enough?

00:06:44.274 --> 00:06:47.574
Are some people scared unless
they can hold us down?

00:06:47.844 --> 00:06:50.584
Kaoru, that's not it! I just...

00:06:50.584 --> 00:06:52.644
He thinks "That might make things easier."

00:06:53.584 --> 00:06:57.124
For just a moment, he thought
"If they couldn't read minds...

00:06:57.124 --> 00:07:00.824
"or enter illegally or collapse walls,
it would be better."

00:07:00.824 --> 00:07:01.664
I see.

00:07:01.664 --> 00:07:02.964
No! Kaoru?

00:07:10.234 --> 00:07:11.674
Whoa...

00:07:12.504 --> 00:07:15.104
Hey, I'm different! I'm an esper too, okay?

00:07:15.814 --> 00:07:18.804
Chief, we just got an emergency
alert from the precogs at HQ!

00:07:19.314 --> 00:07:21.474
Chief, what are you doing?

00:07:21.814 --> 00:07:24.584
Ah... That feels better.

00:07:28.084 --> 00:07:30.294
We have details on the prediction.

00:07:30.294 --> 00:07:32.224
92% probability.

00:07:32.224 --> 00:07:36.694
In 30 minutes, two espers
between Levels 4 and 5...

00:07:36.694 --> 00:07:39.424
will initiate a major drunken brawl.

00:07:39.964 --> 00:07:43.004
Drunks fighting? Oh, for Pete's sake...

00:07:43.004 --> 00:07:45.374
Yeah, but unlike one between ordinary people,

00:07:45.444 --> 00:07:48.414
it's possible this could cause a lot
of damage to their surroundings.

00:07:48.414 --> 00:07:49.974
Oh, that's right.

00:07:49.974 --> 00:07:52.814
The ECM's there for times like these, isn't it?

00:07:52.814 --> 00:07:54.784
Between Levels 4 and 5, huh?

00:07:55.114 --> 00:07:57.884
There shouldn't be that many, but...

00:07:57.884 --> 00:07:59.784
We've reached the airspace over the scene.

00:08:07.694 --> 00:08:09.184
Shockwave!

00:08:11.564 --> 00:08:13.594
Why, you...

00:08:14.504 --> 00:08:16.694
Shockwave, back at ya!

00:08:19.004 --> 00:08:20.904
There's already a crowd of onlookers.

00:08:20.904 --> 00:08:24.544
If this gets on the news, it'll just
cause lots trouble for other espers.

00:08:24.544 --> 00:08:27.574
We'd better take them in
before the media arrives.

00:08:27.914 --> 00:08:29.484
You three ready?

00:08:29.484 --> 00:08:31.214
We can go anytime!

00:08:31.614 --> 00:08:34.524
Okay... The Children, released!

00:08:34.524 --> 00:08:34.754
<<RELEASED>>
Okay... The Children, released!

00:08:34.754 --> 00:08:35.584
<<RELEASED>>

00:08:39.664 --> 00:08:41.254
Bring it!

00:08:43.594 --> 00:08:45.084
Oh, yeah?

00:08:46.364 --> 00:08:47.694
Hold it!

00:08:48.334 --> 00:08:50.634
The fragrant morning is bright-red justice!

00:08:50.634 --> 00:08:52.904
The wind blowing in the field is blue friendship!

00:08:52.904 --> 00:08:55.104
And the violet mixed in is a noble heart!

00:08:55.614 --> 00:08:57.164
The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:08:58.644 --> 00:09:00.084
The crowd's growing.

00:09:00.084 --> 00:09:01.214
Let's catch these guys, fast.

00:09:01.214 --> 00:09:02.874
Let's do it!

00:09:03.154 --> 00:09:06.744
PSYCHIC BRAWL DOUBLE-BUSTER!

00:09:12.394 --> 00:09:14.924
Mr. Minamoto, now! Hurry!

00:09:14.924 --> 00:09:16.824
C'mon, let's get going, too.

00:09:25.504 --> 00:09:26.804
Okay, got 'em.

00:09:26.804 --> 00:09:28.074
Mr. Minamoto!

00:09:28.344 --> 00:09:30.214
These men aren't espers!

00:09:30.214 --> 00:09:30.774
What?!

00:09:30.774 --> 00:09:32.104
What about all that blasting before?

00:09:33.514 --> 00:09:35.174
Electronics hidden under their clothes!

00:09:35.714 --> 00:09:38.114
There's also traces of fireworks that were set up.

00:09:38.114 --> 00:09:39.884
Could this be?

00:09:42.354 --> 00:09:46.764
This was all a trap designed to
lure in you special espers!

00:09:48.464 --> 00:09:49.634
Who are these guys?

00:09:49.634 --> 00:09:51.664
They aren't just a normal crowd?

00:09:51.664 --> 00:09:54.104
No, we're normal.

00:09:54.334 --> 00:09:57.774
And normal people hate espers!

00:09:57.774 --> 00:10:01.574
On their behalf, we stand
firm in battle against you!

00:10:01.574 --> 00:10:05.344
You're that anti-esper group,
the Normal People?!

00:10:05.684 --> 00:10:06.884
Correct!

00:10:06.884 --> 00:10:09.214
Your hatred of espers led you to go this far?!

00:10:09.684 --> 00:10:11.924
You're not normal! Far from it!

00:10:11.924 --> 00:10:15.544
You're wrong! We are! We are normal!

00:10:16.724 --> 00:10:18.694
These guys are the Normal People?!

00:10:18.694 --> 00:10:19.694
Kaoru...

00:10:19.694 --> 00:10:21.824
I'll catch these guys, no prob!

00:10:23.764 --> 00:10:26.664
My power's gone, too! It feels like before!

00:10:27.004 --> 00:10:27.694
ECM!

00:10:27.934 --> 00:10:32.394
Impossible! There's only one ECM in the
nation that can suppress Level 7's!

00:10:33.574 --> 00:10:35.374
The Normal People are everywhere!

00:10:35.744 --> 00:10:36.614
What?!

00:10:36.614 --> 00:10:38.544
Including in the military.

00:10:47.854 --> 00:10:50.824
Yo-de-le-hi-hi! Natsuko here.

00:10:52.724 --> 00:10:55.854
Wow. Why did you yodel? By Hotaru.

00:11:04.034 --> 00:11:06.144
The Children have been taken hostage,

00:11:06.144 --> 00:11:08.834
and it looks like the pilot couldn't fight
them off and was taken as well.

00:11:10.414 --> 00:11:13.444
I've been calling them telepathically
as hard as I can,

00:11:13.444 --> 00:11:15.454
but I'm getting no response at all.

00:11:15.454 --> 00:11:18.214
When I try to scan for them,

00:11:18.214 --> 00:11:21.884
it's almost like they're being shrouded in mist.

00:11:22.094 --> 00:11:23.924
As I thought.

00:11:24.594 --> 00:11:26.494
What do you mean, Chief?

00:11:26.494 --> 00:11:29.394
We just received word from the research center.

00:11:30.164 --> 00:11:32.634
It seems the new ECM has been stolen.

00:11:33.734 --> 00:11:36.174
You mean it was stolen to be used for this?!

00:11:36.174 --> 00:11:40.864
Then Minamoto and The Children
must be close to the ECM.

00:11:41.144 --> 00:11:42.644
No wonder...

00:11:42.644 --> 00:11:46.674
If they harm The Children,
then God help them all.

00:11:55.354 --> 00:12:00.254
All we want is the list of all the
espers BABEL possesses.

00:12:01.024 --> 00:12:03.594
Particularly the list of special espers.

00:12:03.594 --> 00:12:08.904
And for that, we require the password
that you have in your head.

00:12:09.334 --> 00:12:12.244
You appear to be a normal human.

00:12:12.244 --> 00:12:16.614
Don't you think the world would
be better without espers?

00:12:16.614 --> 00:12:20.914
If you help us, we can make that world a reality.

00:12:21.644 --> 00:12:23.314
I refuse.

00:12:23.714 --> 00:12:26.984
In that case, have a taste of some people...

00:12:26.984 --> 00:12:29.754
we've brought from the normal world.

00:12:32.494 --> 00:12:34.554
A normal cafeteria lady.

00:12:36.064 --> 00:12:38.294
A normal pensioner.

00:12:40.364 --> 00:12:42.474
A normal salaryman.

00:12:42.474 --> 00:12:44.574
A normal civil servant.

00:12:44.574 --> 00:12:47.304
And finally, a normal student.

00:12:49.814 --> 00:12:51.544
No... Stop this!

00:12:59.184 --> 00:13:00.454
Mr. Minamoto...

00:13:00.454 --> 00:13:02.794
We can't let them get away with this!

00:13:02.794 --> 00:13:04.894
Listen, you two.

00:13:04.894 --> 00:13:07.494
We can't lose our heads in this situation.

00:13:07.494 --> 00:13:11.554
We need to play this cool and
not provoke them in any way.

00:13:12.234 --> 00:13:15.134
If we screw up, it won't just be
Mr. Minamoto and us who suffer.

00:13:15.134 --> 00:13:17.764
The pilot they captured with
us will be in danger, too.

00:13:19.174 --> 00:13:22.714
Wait for the enemy to let down their
guard and then we'll move, got it?

00:13:22.714 --> 00:13:23.644
Gotcha.

00:13:23.644 --> 00:13:25.204
Roger!

00:13:26.844 --> 00:13:31.014
Why, you dirty Normal People jerks!

00:13:32.284 --> 00:13:33.324
Lemme go! What're you doing?!

00:13:33.324 --> 00:13:35.584
Great. All the sense of a housefly...
Lemme go! What're you doing?!

00:13:35.924 --> 00:13:38.394
Convenient. Let's take this one, then.

00:13:38.394 --> 00:13:40.164
Right.

00:13:40.164 --> 00:13:41.494
Eat THIS!

00:13:44.634 --> 00:13:45.904
Little brat!

00:13:45.904 --> 00:13:47.024
Kaoru!

00:13:47.234 --> 00:13:48.754
Come back here!

00:13:52.604 --> 00:13:54.934
Ow, my hand's stinging now.

00:13:57.674 --> 00:13:59.644
You men...

00:13:59.644 --> 00:14:01.984
You're fighting children,
and we're at your mercy

00:14:01.984 --> 00:14:04.244
because our powers have been suppressed.

00:14:04.484 --> 00:14:07.714
But mark my words, even children
won't forget what you've done.

00:14:09.124 --> 00:14:13.594
We'll have our powers back soon,
and one day we'll be adults.

00:14:13.594 --> 00:14:14.494
Shiho!

00:14:14.494 --> 00:14:17.064
If you harm Kaoru...

00:14:17.064 --> 00:14:20.364
then you're going to regret that you aren't dead.

00:14:20.734 --> 00:14:22.734
Wh-What did you say, you little-

00:14:22.734 --> 00:14:25.104
I said we shouldn't provoke them, you idiot!

00:14:25.104 --> 00:14:26.004
But...

00:14:26.144 --> 00:14:29.104
You keep feelings like that
hidden till the very end!

00:14:29.214 --> 00:14:32.584
Got it? Revenge is a dish best served cold.

00:14:32.584 --> 00:14:34.684
Later on, once we have the advantage,

00:14:34.684 --> 00:14:38.044
we can kick their asses raw as much as we like!

00:14:38.254 --> 00:14:41.914
Sorry, guys. She's kinda silly
and says stuff like that.

00:14:42.824 --> 00:14:45.294
You can't hide your feelings at all, either!

00:14:47.994 --> 00:14:51.594
Dammit, I gotta find some
way to shut that thing off!

00:14:51.594 --> 00:14:54.094
I'm totally helpless as I am now!

00:14:59.774 --> 00:15:02.674
I see you're pretty stubborn, too...

00:15:02.674 --> 00:15:04.334
1st Lieutenant Koichi Minamoto.

00:15:06.684 --> 00:15:09.084
We don't have time for that.

00:15:09.084 --> 00:15:11.414
Couldn't you be a little less uncooperative?

00:15:11.884 --> 00:15:14.354
Tell us the password.

00:15:14.654 --> 00:15:16.554
Otherwise...

00:15:19.624 --> 00:15:20.954
Kaoru!

00:15:21.724 --> 00:15:23.864
M-Minamoto...

00:15:23.864 --> 00:15:27.534
Now, what will you do?
Do you want to hear her scream?

00:15:27.534 --> 00:15:29.164
You son of a!

00:15:31.404 --> 00:15:33.674
Stop it! Is that human?!

00:15:33.674 --> 00:15:35.934
That's right! You people
aren't normal at all!

00:15:36.314 --> 00:15:38.884
That's not for an esper to say!

00:15:38.884 --> 00:15:41.244
Yeah! We're normal!

00:15:41.784 --> 00:15:46.124
We Normal People don't
consider espers to be human!

00:15:46.124 --> 00:15:49.114
They're monsters, with strange powers!

00:15:49.794 --> 00:15:53.744
They're new life forms, the
natural enemies of humans!

00:15:55.094 --> 00:15:57.934
Well, I have news for you, then!

00:15:57.934 --> 00:16:00.834
Even espers have families and lives!

00:16:00.834 --> 00:16:03.004
Are you just going to trample all of that?!

00:16:03.004 --> 00:16:05.104
I have no intention of debating the matter.

00:16:05.104 --> 00:16:09.164
We have three of those things here.
We can afford to lose one.

00:16:16.014 --> 00:16:18.854
All right. Just don't hurt her!

00:16:20.254 --> 00:16:21.584
The password?

00:16:21.584 --> 00:16:23.624
Minamoto, no!

00:16:23.624 --> 00:16:25.424
"Save the Children"...

00:16:25.424 --> 00:16:26.484
Minamoto!

00:16:27.894 --> 00:16:31.264
Excellent! If you'd just been
cooperative from the start,

00:16:31.264 --> 00:16:32.964
you could have spared yourself all that pain.

00:16:32.964 --> 00:16:33.864
"EMERGENCY COUNTERMEASURES ENGAGED"
you could have spared yourself all that pain.

00:16:33.864 --> 00:16:33.904
"EMERGENCY COUNTERMEASURES ENGAGED"

00:16:33.904 --> 00:16:35.364
"EMERGENCY COUNTERMEASURES ENGAGED"
Emergency mode, engaged.

00:16:35.364 --> 00:16:36.194
Emergency mode, engaged.

00:16:36.874 --> 00:16:39.564
Now deleting all data files.

00:16:39.674 --> 00:16:41.274
What's happening?!

00:16:41.274 --> 00:16:43.874
Um... I didn't do anything.

00:16:43.874 --> 00:16:45.074
You fell for it.

00:16:45.074 --> 00:16:45.944
What?!

00:16:45.944 --> 00:16:51.614
I figured if I held out long enough,
you'd bring one of them here!

00:16:51.614 --> 00:16:52.624
You!

00:16:52.624 --> 00:16:54.524
Now engaging ECCM.

00:16:55.084 --> 00:16:56.624
ECCM?

00:16:56.624 --> 00:16:59.264
Kaoru! Blow these guys away!

00:16:59.264 --> 00:17:00.924
But, my powers!

00:17:01.564 --> 00:17:02.994
They're back!

00:17:06.504 --> 00:17:08.664
PSYCHIC ANYWHERE DOOR!

00:17:19.744 --> 00:17:21.444
What was that?

00:17:21.444 --> 00:17:22.844
Our powers are back!

00:17:22.954 --> 00:17:25.004
Huh? You're right!

00:17:32.094 --> 00:17:33.594
You okay, Minamoto?

00:17:33.594 --> 00:17:34.894
Yeah.

00:17:34.894 --> 00:17:36.864
What's ECCM?

00:17:36.864 --> 00:17:41.994
ESP Counter-Countermeasures.
It renders ECM ineffective.

00:17:42.064 --> 00:17:42.934
It does?

00:17:42.934 --> 00:17:43.334
"ECCM ENGAGED"
It does?

00:17:43.334 --> 00:17:48.204
"ECCM ENGAGED"
If ECM is realized, then it could be
misused by people up to no good.

00:17:48.204 --> 00:17:51.874
"ECCM ENGAGED"
We needed to think of a way to counter it.

00:17:52.444 --> 00:17:57.144
That's why BABEL was taking such an
active role in its development.

00:17:57.554 --> 00:17:58.484
Mr. Minamoto!

00:17:58.484 --> 00:17:59.254
Kaoru!

00:17:59.254 --> 00:18:01.944
Move it! We have to disable the
ECM while we have this chance!

00:18:02.524 --> 00:18:05.584
This is for emergencies, and the
batteries won't last long.

00:18:09.734 --> 00:18:11.754
Screw with us, huh?!

00:18:12.364 --> 00:18:15.024
Filthy espers and your BABEL dog!

00:18:15.304 --> 00:18:18.204
You're the destroyers of the
natural order of the world!

00:18:18.604 --> 00:18:20.934
Shoot! Eliminate the espers!

00:18:21.844 --> 00:18:22.904
Eat this!

00:18:25.984 --> 00:18:28.004
Stand your ground! Shoot!

00:18:29.014 --> 00:18:32.344
PSYCHIC AEGIS SHIELD!

00:18:38.954 --> 00:18:43.434
It's no use. Those girls are still
unremarkable. They're going to die.

00:18:43.434 --> 00:18:46.024
No. Look closely.

00:18:46.534 --> 00:18:48.524
See the queen's true power.

00:18:49.274 --> 00:18:54.264
No one... No thing on Earth can stop her.

00:18:54.574 --> 00:18:56.234
Keep shooting! Kill them!

00:19:03.014 --> 00:19:04.984
The battery's nearly dead!

00:19:11.694 --> 00:19:13.594
Cease fire! You'll hit the ECM!

00:19:20.964 --> 00:19:23.674
You really have been more
trouble than you're worth.

00:19:23.674 --> 00:19:27.034
Give up. You're finished.

00:19:31.144 --> 00:19:31.834
Die.

00:19:32.744 --> 00:19:33.574
Kaoru!

00:19:35.244 --> 00:19:37.774
MINAMOTO!

00:19:58.804 --> 00:20:01.434
Impossible! The ECM is!

00:20:08.744 --> 00:20:11.044
What... What are you, you little!

00:20:16.524 --> 00:20:17.854
Kaoru...

00:20:19.054 --> 00:20:21.924
Monster! You're nothing but a monster!

00:20:21.924 --> 00:20:24.364
I'll do to you what you did to Minamoto.

00:20:30.004 --> 00:20:32.264
Kaoru, stop it!

00:20:37.744 --> 00:20:40.414
Kaoru, stop it! It's over!

00:20:40.414 --> 00:20:43.714
They're beaten! They see no value
to you beyond your powers!

00:20:44.214 --> 00:20:46.424
That's why they fear espers!

00:20:46.424 --> 00:20:50.254
They aren't worth dirtying your hands over!

00:21:00.834 --> 00:21:01.924
Kaoru...

00:21:09.474 --> 00:21:11.564
Kaoru, are you all right?

00:21:13.514 --> 00:21:14.604
Kaoru.

00:21:17.384 --> 00:21:19.074
See?

00:21:30.994 --> 00:21:32.264
What?!

00:21:33.534 --> 00:21:35.134
The ECM...

00:21:35.134 --> 00:21:39.134
There's no need for it. A thing like this.

00:21:39.134 --> 00:21:40.974
Not for us.

00:21:42.244 --> 00:21:44.644
You can be stopped.

00:21:45.774 --> 00:21:48.744
But not by weapons or machines.

00:21:50.354 --> 00:21:52.784
Do you understand, Kaoru?

00:22:07.704 --> 00:22:09.894
Help.

00:22:19.414 --> 00:22:24.544
There's no point in hiding it

00:22:24.854 --> 00:22:28.914
I know everything

00:22:29.654 --> 00:22:35.094
It's no mystery, because

00:22:35.464 --> 00:22:40.864
I love you

00:22:41.104 --> 00:22:45.504
Go on, look at me

00:22:45.774 --> 00:22:50.074
Truly, the bond of love we share

00:22:50.074 --> 00:22:52.044
Is absolute!

00:22:52.274 --> 00:22:56.984
An eternal, unchanging

00:22:56.984 --> 00:23:03.624
Absolute declaration to the world
I'll shout from Everest!

00:23:03.624 --> 00:23:08.464
I've accepted it

00:23:08.464 --> 00:23:12.864
The bond of love we share

00:23:12.864 --> 00:23:15.064
Is absolute!

00:23:15.064 --> 00:23:19.504
My wish, when fortune smiles on me

00:23:19.804 --> 00:23:23.914
In San Pietro, I'll swear it to you

00:23:23.914 --> 00:23:26.704
An absolute declaration of love!

00:23:39.894 --> 00:23:41.024
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:41.024 --> 00:23:42.854
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Psychic Kids Squad!

00:23:43.094 --> 00:23:44.994
My name is Muscle Ohkama.

00:23:44.994 --> 00:23:46.834
Currently, I am employed as a farmer.

00:23:46.834 --> 00:23:48.704
Inside of some rather high walls.

00:23:48.704 --> 00:23:49.804
I see you're working hard.

00:23:49.804 --> 00:23:52.134
Eek! Major! It's been too long!

00:23:52.134 --> 00:23:53.344
Whose voice is that?

00:23:53.344 --> 00:23:55.104
Muscle Ohkama, the guy from the first episode.

00:23:55.104 --> 00:23:58.344
Well, he can keep coming and
I'll keep on kicking his butt!

00:23:58.344 --> 00:23:59.844
Psychic Kids Squad!

00:23:59.844 --> 00:24:03.054
