Oh, my queen. Hurry and grow to adulthood.

00:24:04.914 --> 00:24:05.554
Kyosuke Hyobu!
Ah! He's Appeared?
Oh, my queen. Hurry and grow to adulthood.

00:24:05.554 --> 00:24:07.954
Kyosuke Hyobu!
Ah! He's Appeared?
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

